तत्र भवे छन्दसि — In छन्दस् (Vedas), यत् comes after a locative-case word meaning "stays there":

Examples: मेघ्यः, विद्युत्यः in: नमो मेघ्याय च विद्युत्याय च

@note[Debars अण्, घ etc. (@ref[4.3.53]). Those affixes also apply in Vedic usage. छन्दसि governs all sūtras to end of chapter. भवे governs through @ref[4.4.118].]
